    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27255" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lūsĭo</span></b> ,
		ōnis, f.
		ludo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a playing, play</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in ludum discendi, non lusionis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Q. Fr. 3, 4, 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pueri lusionibus vel laboriosis delectantur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Fin. 5, 20, 55</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in ipsā lusione (pilae),</span>”
				<i>in the act of playing</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					de Or. 1, 16, 73</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pilaris lusio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat. S. 4 praef.</span></i>
			</div>
